  "motionAtlas.atomic-outbox-commit.creativeDirection":
    "960x600 React/SVG, shared palette, deterministic 180 frames at 30fps. Frames 0-12 reveal the scene. Frames 13-55 write a local change and matching journal ticket on two halves of one sheet. Frames 56-110 close one shared commit latch. Frames 111-139 stamp both halves when committed, or withdraw both provisional halves when aborted. Hold the resolved meaning during frames 140-165. Frames 166-179 return to the same opaque ground for a six-second loop; reset is editorial.",
