  "motionAtlas.atomic-outbox-commit.default.labels.pending": "Provisional",
  "motionAtlas.atomic-outbox-commit.description":
    "A local edit and its matching outbound journal entry sit under one transaction latch. Both become durable together, or neither does, so an accepted edit cannot lose the obligation to synchronize it.",
  "motionAtlas.atomic-outbox-commit.distinction":
    "Journal-receipts starts with an existing outbox and closes obligations after acknowledgment. This explains how the obligation is created atomically with the source mutation before any network activity.",
  "motionAtlas.atomic-outbox-commit.domains.0": "Editorial illustration",
  "motionAtlas.atomic-outbox-commit.goodFor.0":
    "Explain transactional outbox crash safety",
  "motionAtlas.atomic-outbox-commit.goodFor.1":
    "Show that local persistence and sync obligations commit together",
  "motionAtlas.atomic-outbox-commit.intent":
    "Bind a durable local change to its durable synchronization obligation.",
  "motionAtlas.atomic-outbox-commit.motionBeats.0":
    "Write the local proposal and matching journal proposal.",
  "motionAtlas.atomic-outbox-commit.motionBeats.1":
    "Close one latch around both provisional halves.",
  "motionAtlas.atomic-outbox-commit.motionBeats.2":
    "Stamp both durable halves or withdraw both proposals.",
  "motionAtlas.atomic-outbox-commit.motionBeats.3":
    "Hold the resolved relationship.",
  "motionAtlas.atomic-outbox-commit.name":
    "Save the change and its delivery obligation together",
  "motionAtlas.atomic-outbox-commit.notFor.0":
    "The shared transaction boundary is an authored protocol assumption.",
  "motionAtlas.atomic-outbox-commit.notFor.1":
    "Atomic local commit does not imply exactly-once remote delivery.",
  "motionAtlas.atomic-outbox-commit.notFor.2":
    "No network success is depicted. The committed journal entry remains pending.",
  "motionAtlas.atomic-outbox-commit.notFor.3":
    "No real product screen, external fetch, supplied code execution, or measured performance claim. All text is authored; no JSX, functions or URLs in props.",
  "motionAtlas.atomic-outbox-commit.notFor.4":
    "Supplied prose is preserved. Fictional framing, evidence and agreement between wording and selected states are authoring responsibilities. Runtime validation enforces structural bounds and explicit cross-field rules.",
  "motionAtlas.atomic-outbox-commit.prompt":
    "Bind a durable local change to its durable synchronization obligation.",
