  "motionAtlas.batch-release.controls.showItemLabels": "showItemLabels",
  "motionAtlas.batch-release.controls.showItemLabels.help":
    "Preserves individual labels inside each moving batch envelope. boolean",
  "motionAtlas.batch-release.creativeDirection":
    "After the entrance, item tokens arrive separately at a shallow loading cradle during 18..62. A bracket grows around the supplied group but remains open while any member is missing. At 68, the final item docks, the bracket closes into an envelope, and the supplied release caption appears. During 82..112, the envelope crosses one dispatch line with its member tokens still visible inside. If a second batch is supplied, its shorter arrival and release sequence occupies 94..146 in a second cradle. Hold the released envelopes and their exact contents through 168, then fade to ground. The transformation is many arrivals becoming one handled bundle without combining their contents.",
  "motionAtlas.batch-release.default.batches.0.items.0.label": "A",
  "motionAtlas.batch-release.default.batches.0.items.1.label": "B",
  "motionAtlas.batch-release.default.batches.0.items.2.label": "C",
