  "motionAtlas.batch-release.default.releaseLabel": "Group complete",
  "motionAtlas.batch-release.description":
    "Individual items wait together inside a forming batch boundary. Once every item in the supplied group arrives, the boundary closes and the group crosses the dispatch boundary as one unit.",
  "motionAtlas.batch-release.distinction":
    "Source-merge converges inputs into a shared destination; this preserves separate items inside a new handling boundary and explains the wait before one dispatch. The batch envelope, not a relabeled row of cards, is the hero transformation.",
