  "motionAtlas.charge-reference-alignment.controls.showDifference.help":
    "Shows the signed total-amount difference only after complete context agreement. boolean; totals are quantity times unitPriceMinor; difference equals invoice total minus reference total; mismatch suppresses both numeric difference and difference geometry",
  "motionAtlas.charge-reference-alignment.controls.showDifference.label":
    "Show difference",
  "motionAtlas.charge-reference-alignment.creativeDirection":
    "Frames 0-11 reveal a short invoice strip and a separate reference sheet on a 960x600 canvas. Frames 12-70 slide their context windows into vertical registration, retaining a visible notch at each mismatched key. When every key and quantity agrees, frames 71-125 extend the two total-amount rulers from the same zero and open a signed difference bracket. Otherwise the amounts stay separate without a difference bracket. Frames 126-167 hold the matched or unresolved context, source labels, and review caption. Exit to the shared opaque ground at frames 168-179. The six-second React/SVG sequence is deterministic at 30fps.",
