  "motionAtlas.choropleth-class-breaks.creativeDirection":
    "React/SVG 960x600 canvas, shared palette, deterministic 180 frames at 30fps. This is schematic local geography with no real basemap. Frames 0-12 reveal. Frames 13-50 align four zone tiles with one common value ruler and initial break markers. Frames 51-110 slide markers to the second scheme and recolor each zone only as its fixed value crosses a threshold. Frames 111-139 hold both labeled legends and unchanged zone numbers. Hold at frames 140-165; fade to the same opaque ground at frames 166-179 for an editorial loop.",
