    "Reveal the supplied roster at named desks and a day label. Across the authored day changes, the same learner silhouettes occupy or vacate their own desks while absent seats keep empty outlines and unknown seats keep question markers. Preserve small day impressions beneath each desk instead of sending people through lanes. Hold the final room with present, absent, unknown and roster totals before fading.",
