  "motionAtlas.classroom-day-presence.description":
    "A fixed classroom shows which members of one fictional roster are present across several school days. Empty seats and unknown attendance remain visibly different.",
  "motionAtlas.classroom-day-presence.distinction":
    "Uses persistent desks and occupied space across school days, rather than a dot matrix or a cohort flowing through dose-return lanes. The explanatory change is daily room occupancy, with absent and unknown records retained as separate states.",
