  "motionAtlas.cold-chain-custody.description":
    "The same vaccine carrier or specimen container passes through authored custody stops. Identity, seal state, monitoring records and acknowledgements stay visible and distinct throughout the handoffs.",
  "motionAtlas.cold-chain-custody.distinction":
    "Merges cold-chain monitoring and specimen identity tracking. Unlike the generic custody-transfer gate, this preserves a multi-stop identity/record ledger and may show missing evidence after physical receipt.",
  "motionAtlas.cold-chain-custody.domains.0": "Physical logistics and custody",
  "motionAtlas.cold-chain-custody.goodFor.0":
    "Explain why a shipment needs both custody and condition records.",
