  "motionAtlas.community-coordination-table.creativeDirection":
    "Within six seconds, reveal a tabletop map with authored community requests and team markers at their starting assignments. Where two team markers overlap, the community representative points to the requested destination; the reassigned team lifts its own marker and places it at that destination. Turn the relevant request tags face-up to show the configured final assignments, then hold the full plan with all remaining requests still visible. Use the shared opaque entrance and exit envelope, and avoid turning the whole map green.",
