  "motionAtlas.community-coordination-table.description":
    "Community representatives and response teams rearrange physical service markers on a shared schematic tabletop map. An overlapping assignment moves to a requested location so the final plan reflects an explicit community priority.",
  "motionAtlas.community-coordination-table.distinction":
    "The main action is a participant lifting and relocating a physical assignment in response to a visible community request. Unlike radial-network or schema-mapping, no abstract hub distributes signals and the plan is revised rather than merely connected.",
  "motionAtlas.community-coordination-table.domains.0":
    "Participatory spatial planning",
  "motionAtlas.community-coordination-table.goodFor.0":
    "Explain a fictional coordination meeting about duplicated coverage",
  "motionAtlas.community-coordination-table.goodFor.1":
    "Show community input changing where a team plans to work",
  "motionAtlas.community-coordination-table.goodFor.2":
    "Contrast initial assignments with an agreed allocation",
  "motionAtlas.community-coordination-table.intent":
    "Show a community request changing a shared plan while preserving visibility of what remains unassigned.",
  "motionAtlas.community-coordination-table.motionBeats.0":
    "Reveal the map and initial assignments; representative indicates the requested destination.",
  "motionAtlas.community-coordination-table.motionBeats.1":
    "The moving team lifts, carries and places its own marker.",
  "motionAtlas.community-coordination-table.motionBeats.2":
    "Turn request tags face-up with the agreed assignments.",
  "motionAtlas.community-coordination-table.motionBeats.3":
    "Hold the full plan and every remaining request.",
  "motionAtlas.community-coordination-table.motionBeats.4":
    "Return to the opaque ground through the shared envelope.",
  "motionAtlas.community-coordination-table.name":
    "Rebalance a shared response",
  "motionAtlas.community-coordination-table.notFor.0":
    "Markers represent authored team assignments, not measured coverage, beneficiary counts, delivery capacity, or verified access.",
  "motionAtlas.community-coordination-table.notFor.1":
    "The final scene is an agreed illustrative plan, not evidence that a service reached a location.",
  "motionAtlas.community-coordination-table.notFor.2":
    "The map is schematic and has no real geography or travel scale; no automatic allocation or route calculation is implied.",
  "motionAtlas.community-coordination-table.notFor.3":
    "Service compatibility is an author-validated semantic constraint; the renderer cannot infer needs or determine an appropriate humanitarian response.",
  "motionAtlas.community-coordination-table.prompt":
    "Rebalance a shared response. Show a community request changing a shared plan while preserving visibility of what remains unassigned.",
