  "motionAtlas.component-material-return.description":
    "A returned object opens into identifiable components that follow reuse, repair, recycling or residue routes. Reassembled output and separate material bins reconcile with returned mass plus any replacement inputs.",
  "motionAtlas.component-material-return.distinction":
    "Identifiable parts physically disassemble and some reassemble into a new whole. The explicit external input and residue prevent the closed-circle illusion of a generic circular arrow.",
