  "motionAtlas.convoy-route-detour.creativeDirection":
    "Reveal a depot, destination, and two roads within six seconds. The vehicle rolls toward the blocked segment, brakes before the barrier, then pivots at the preceding junction as the alternative route gains emphasis. The vehicle follows that authored detour to the destination, where the receiving team opens the gate; hold both the still-blocked road and the arrived vehicle before the shared opaque exit fade. Do not erase the obstruction or imply that a route was automatically verified.",
