  "motionAtlas.custody-transfer.controls.waiting": "waiting",
  "motionAtlas.custody-transfer.creativeDirection":
    "Reveal one labeled object held by the sender's bracket. The receiving bracket approaches from the opposite side and makes contact while the sender still supports the object. In the accepted outcome, the recipient's acknowledgment seal lands, the responsibility marker crosses the shared contact zone, and only then does the sender withdraw. In the waiting outcome, retain sender support and hold at the contact zone without an ownership change. Finish on an unambiguous owner state within the six-second envelope.",
