  "motionAtlas.custody-transfer.default.object.label": "Example shift brief",
  "motionAtlas.custody-transfer.description":
    "A work object remains supported by its current holder until the next holder visibly accepts it. Acknowledgment changes responsibility before the first support withdraws.",
  "motionAtlas.custody-transfer.distinction":
    "The key action is overlapping physical support with delayed release, not a task passing through pipeline stages. Unlike journal-receipts, there is one responsibility marker and custody changes only after acceptance.",
  "motionAtlas.custody-transfer.domains.0": "Editorial explanation",
  "motionAtlas.custody-transfer.goodFor.0":
    "Explain a support shift handoff that requires acceptance",
