  "motionAtlas.disclosure-aperture.creativeDirection":
    "Reveal one local document behind a tall boundary panel and an empty disclosure envelope outside it. Each authored share field briefly lifts as a duplicate while the original stays printed; a precisely sized aperture opens only opposite that field and lets its duplicate pass into the envelope. Retained fields never lift or leave. Close the aperture and hold the complete original beside the selected disclosure contents, then return to the opaque loop ground.",
