  "motionAtlas.document-region-drift-check.creativeDirection":
    "960x600 React/SVG, shared palette, frame-driven 180 frames at 30fps. Frames 0-12 reveal the scene. Frames 13-50 align saved and current page outlines at the same region coordinates. Frames 51-100 compare the header and fingerprint tags independently. Frames 101-139 either register a match or close a review latch when either tag differs. Hold the resolved relationship at frames 140-165, then fade to the same opaque ground at 166-179. Reset is editorial.",
  "motionAtlas.document-region-drift-check.default.copy.context":
    "Fictional document",
