  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.creativeDirection":
    "960x600 React/SVG, shared palette, deterministic 180 frames at 30fps. Frames 0-12 reveal the scene. Frames 13-52 place each candidate on the none/view/edit/admin ladder. Frames 53-100 close gates for disabled conditions and for the app default when restriction applies. Frames 101-139 raise a result marker to the maximum eligible rank or leave it at none, then compare that marker visibly against a separate required-role notch to resolve allowed or denied. Hold the resolved meaning during frames 140-165. Frames 166-179 return to the same opaque ground for a six-second loop; reset is editorial.",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.default.grants.0.label":
    "App default",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.default.grants.1.label":
    "Team share",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.default.grants.2.label":
    "Direct share",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.default.labels.admin": "Manage",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.default.labels.allowed":
    "Action allowed",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.default.labels.denied":
    "Action denied",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.default.labels.editor": "Edit",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.default.labels.none": "None",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.default.labels.resource":
    "Fictional shared report",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.default.labels.viewer": "View",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.description":
    "Candidate grants line up on a role ladder. Ineligible grants fold away and the highest remaining role determines access; a restricted resource removes the default app grant without removing explicit shares.",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.distinction":
    "Unlike capability-matrix, this computes a maximum over eligible grants and explains why a candidate is excluded. It is neither first-match precedence nor a blanket role inheritance ladder.",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.domains.0": "Editorial illustration",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.goodFor.0":
    "Explain maximum role across qualifying shares",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.goodFor.1":
    "Show why restriction removes defaults but leaves explicit grants",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.intent":
    "Resolve eligible grants and compare the result with an action requirement.",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.motionBeats.0":
    "Place each candidate on its authored role rank.",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.motionBeats.1":
    "Close ineligible and restricted app-default gates.",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.motionBeats.2":
    "Raise the maximum surviving role and compare its requirement.",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.motionBeats.3":
    "Hold the resolved relationship.",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.name":
    "Combine the grants that actually apply",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.notFor.0":
    "Bounded grant composition only. Owner/admin short circuits, public publication and extra row-selection policies are outside this simplified algorithm.",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.notFor.1":
    "No permissions are actually granted by this graphic.",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.notFor.2":
    "No real product screen, external fetch, supplied code execution, or measured performance claim. All text is authored; no JSX, functions or URLs in props.",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.notFor.3":
    "This simplified grant calculation excludes independent read-visibility policies. Do not infer every operation from one effective-role result.",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.notFor.4":
    "Supplied prose is preserved. Fictional framing, evidence and agreement between wording and selected states are authoring responsibilities. Runtime validation enforces structural bounds and explicit cross-field rules.",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.prompt":
    "Resolve eligible grants and compare the result with an action requirement.",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.tags.0": "RBAC",
  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.tags.1": "permission grants",
