  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.creativeDirection":
    "960x600 React/SVG, shared palette, deterministic 180 frames at 30fps. Frames 0-12 reveal the scene. Frames 13-48 align a unique key spine down the center. Frames 49-105 stack repeated observations beside their key and collapse their numeric values by sum. Frames 106-139 attach the derived value to each spine row, leaving a labeled missing field where no observations match. Hold the resolved meaning during frames 140-165. Frames 166-179 return to the same opaque ground for a six-second loop; reset is editorial.",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.default.copy.after": "After",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.default.copy.before": "Before",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.default.copy.context": "Fictional example",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.default.entities.0.label": "Site A",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.default.entities.1.label": "Site B",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.default.entities.2.label": "Site C",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.default.field.label": "Recorded items",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.default.field.missingLabel":
    "No observation",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.default.field.unit": "items",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.description":
    "A fixed list of unique entity keys forms a central record spine. Repeated source observations feed values into those records while unmatched fields remain missing and source rows never multiply the entity count.",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.distinction":
    "Unlike keyed-row-zipper, this is not a two-table row join. A unique spine fixes output grain before repeated observations are aggregated, avoiding join fan-out.",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.domains.0": "Editorial illustration",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.goodFor.0":
    "Explain case records assembled from repeated observations",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.goodFor.1":
    "Prevent one-to-many source rows from multiplying entity counts",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.intent":
    "Preserve entity membership while deriving fields from repeated observations.",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.motionBeats.0":
    "Align a fixed unique entity spine.",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.motionBeats.1":
    "Stack and sum observations beside their exact entity key.",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.motionBeats.2":
    "Attach one derived value or a missing field to every entity.",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.motionBeats.3":
    "Hold the resolved meaning.",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.name": "Keep one record per entity",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.notFor.0":
    "No identity matching is inferred; key equality is explicit.",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.notFor.1":
    "Stored entity membership and computed attribute values are separate, and the animation makes no permanent-value storage claim.",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.notFor.2":
    "Sum is the only calculation in this preset; use grouped-value-picker to explain alternatives.",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.notFor.3":
    "No real product screen, external fetch, supplied code execution, or measured performance claim. All text is authored; no JSX, functions or URLs in props.",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.notFor.4":
    "Supplied prose is preserved. Fictional framing, source completeness and agreement between labels and structured state are author responsibilities. Runtime validation enforces structural bounds and exact cross-field rules.",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.notFor.5":
    "Literal IDs and row values preserve exact whitespace using visible whitespace marks at a fixed readable size.",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.prompt":
    "Preserve entity membership while deriving fields from repeated observations.",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.tags.0": "case management",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.tags.1": "ontology-based access",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.tags.2": "entity spine",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.tags.3": "one record per entity",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.tags.4": "virtual fields",
  "motionAtlas.entity-spine-assembly.useWhen":
    "Preserve entity membership while deriving fields from repeated observations.",
