  "motionAtlas.environmental-observation-gaps.description":
    "A recognizable globe opens onto a schematic environmental observation tile. A cloud mask leaves missing cells blank, and a field-check marker adds point evidence without filling the surrounding unsampled area.",
  "motionAtlas.environmental-observation-gaps.distinction":
    "Masks preserve spatial gaps while a second sampling support is layered over them. This is neither a scanning band nor a node network, and it avoids converting point evidence into invented area coverage.",
  "motionAtlas.environmental-observation-gaps.domains.0":
    "Globe-to-tile reveal with masked observations",
