  "motionAtlas.environmental-observation-gaps.motionBeats.1":
    "Reveal the globe as geographic context, then unfold a detached schematic observation tile. A cloud layer lifts to reveal supplied cell readings while missing cells retain their hatch. A field team places the supplied point checks without replacing any whole-cell missing value. Hold the distinction between point sampling and area coverage, then fade.",
