    "Show item sizes",
  "motionAtlas.equal-count-unequal-volume.creativeDirection":
    "Frames 0-11 reveal two labeled shelves containing the same number of authored items. Frames 12-48 align their count marks one for one. Frames 49-110 unfold each item horizontally into an adjacent byte-length strip while retaining its small identity tab; both shelves share one fixed zero and scale. Frames 111-145 show the derived collection totals beneath the unchanged count marks. Hold through frame 167 with the supplied measurement basis and proxy note, then fade to the shared opaque ground through frame 179. Use the same palette, 960x600 React/SVG canvas, deterministic 180-frame timing, and 30fps.",
  "motionAtlas.equal-count-unequal-volume.default.copy.count": "Item count",
  "motionAtlas.equal-count-unequal-volume.default.copy.example":
    "Fictional byte quantities",
  "motionAtlas.equal-count-unequal-volume.default.copy.proxyNote":
    "Count alone does not determine size",
