  "motionAtlas.exception-detour.creativeDirection":
    "The standard rule and straight destination appear first. A single labeled case approaches the gate, pauses as its exception condition opens a side latch, and follows a curved detour to the exception outcome. The standard path remains intact and visible throughout. The final hold brackets the case, condition, and special outcome before the shared exit.",
