  "motionAtlas.expectation-overlay-check.controls.tests.observed": "Observed",
  "motionAtlas.expectation-overlay-check.creativeDirection":
    "Frames 12..42 reveal up to three test stations with short input captions. Frames 43..108 register the expected translucent strip over each observed strip, matching their fixed left edges. For lower, translate it vertically into place. For hinge, rotate it around its fixed upper edge and settle it flat before judging equality. Equal strings register into a double outline. Unequal strings separate vertically and retain both complete values with a mismatch bracket. A null observation retains an empty lower slot and never receives a verdict. Frames 109..167 hold all tests, expected results, observations and derived states together. Use deterministic frame-driven React/SVG at 960x600, 180 frames and 30 fps, with the shared palette. Reveal during frames 0..11 and fade to the common opaque ground during frames 168..179.",
