    "Make a test judgment inspectable through its expected and observed values.",
  "motionAtlas.expectation-overlay-check.literal-whitespace":
    "Whitespace uses amber presentation markers, distinct from authored marker glyphs. Exact original values remain unchanged.",
  "motionAtlas.expectation-overlay-check.name":
    "Compare the observed result with its expectation",
  "motionAtlas.expectation-overlay-check.notFor.0":
    "No software or model is executed. The cases and observations are authored examples.",
  "motionAtlas.expectation-overlay-check.notFor.1":
    "A finite set of matches does not establish safety, reliability, quality, or complete test coverage.",
  "motionAtlas.expectation-overlay-check.notFor.2":
    "String equality is the only comparison. No semantic equivalence, tolerance, hidden normalization, or causal diagnosis is inferred.",
  "motionAtlas.expectation-overlay-check.notFor.3":
    "Free prose is author supplied; only structural, reference, numeric and documented lexical constraints are runtime-validated.",
  "motionAtlas.expectation-overlay-check.prompt":
    "An expected-result sheet aligns over an observed-result sheet for each authored test. Matching wording registers exactly, mismatches separate into a visible gap, and unobserved results remain untested.",
