  "motionAtlas.expertise-role-exchange.creativeDirection":
    "Frames 12..34 reveal two people beside one shared worktable with unchanged role labels. Frames 35..82 show the first topic expert aligning a guide on the table while the other observes. The topic strip then turns to the second topic. Frames 83..130 pass the demonstration tool to the other person, who demonstrates their supplied topic while the first takes the observing position. Frames 131..167 hold both topic-expert attributions and both unchanged job roles. Use deterministic frame-driven React/SVG at 960x600, 180 frames and 30 fps, with the shared palette. Reveal during frames 0..11 and fade to the common opaque ground during frames 168..179.",
