    "Show review trail",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.controls.showRoundLabels":
    "Show round labels",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.creativeDirection":
    "Frames 12..32 establish an author station, a reviewer station, and one readable draft between them. During 32..62, the draft crosses to the reviewer and an authored feedback tab attaches to its edge. During 62..94, it returns with that tab visibly tethered to the draft, and the draft text wipes into the supplied revised wording. During 94..132, the revised draft crosses back along the same route; the feedback tab detaches into a small review trail and the closing outcome settles beside the draft. For two supplied rounds, divide frames 32..144 evenly between their paired return trips. Hold the final draft through 168, then exit. The object changes between trips rather than merely retrying the same operation.",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.default.artifactLabel": "Sample message",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.default.finalLabel": "Ready to share",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.default.roleLabels.author": "Writer",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.default.roleLabels.reviewer": "Reviewer",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.default.rounds.0.draft": "Share update",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.default.rounds.0.feedback":
    "Name the next step",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.default.rounds.0.label": "Pass A",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.default.rounds.0.revised":
    "Review the draft",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.description":
    "A short draft travels to a reviewer and returns with an attached note. The author changes the draft in response and sends the revised version back for the supplied closing outcome.",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.distinction":
    "Retry-backoff repeats an unchanged operation; this makes feedback alter the artifact before it returns. Data cleanup transforms records according to a rule, whereas this shows an authored human review exchange with its note retained.",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.domains.0": "Iterative work",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.goodFor.0":
    "Explaining a review-and-revision workflow",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.goodFor.1":
    "Showing how a specific note changes a draft",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.goodFor.2":
    "Introducing short feedback iterations without claiming an objective quality score",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.goodFor.3":
    "Show a community contribution receiving an explicit maintainer response",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.goodFor.4":
    "Connect a participant concern to an authored product or service revision",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.goodFor.5":
    "Show an open design draft revised after an authored community comment",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.goodFor.6":
    "Explain respectful peer feedback with a retained comment trail",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.intent":
    "Connect a concrete piece of feedback to an authored revision.",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.motionBeats.0":
    "Establish the author, reviewer and current draft.",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.motionBeats.1":
    "Carry feedback back with each draft and wipe into the supplied revision. Two rounds divide this span equally.",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.motionBeats.2":
    "Hold the final authored revision, outcome and optional note trail.",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.name": "Revise through feedback",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.notFor.0":
    "The default exchange and outcome are fictional.",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.notFor.1":
    "The renderer displays supplied revisions and does not generate, evaluate, or infer improvements.",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.notFor.2":
    "Short text snippets stand for the artifact; simultaneous reviewers, contradictory notes, approvals with legal effect, and full document editing are outside this scene.",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.notFor.3":
    "The depicted revision must follow the supplied note and closing outcome. A contribution does not imply automatic upstream acceptance, deployment, broad representativeness, or improved social outcomes.",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.notFor.4":
    "A submitted comment does not prove consent, adoption, representation of the whole community or that every concern has been resolved. The closing label must reflect the authored outcome.",
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.prompt":
    'Use Motion Atlas "Revise through feedback" (feedback-refinement) as a conceptual graphic. Connect a concrete piece of feedback to an authored revision. Replace fictional sample content with approved authored content before making product claims.',
  "motionAtlas.feedback-refinement.tags.0": "feedback",
