  "motionAtlas.field-conflict-choice.creativeDirection":
    "Frames 12-42 show one record with parallel source columns. Between frames 42-112, authored choice rails move toward the selected source for each resolved field, lifting that value into the result column. An unresolved field keeps both alternatives separated by a review bracket. Rejected alternatives remain in a quieter side ledger when enabled. Hold resolved and unresolved fields together through frame 166 before exiting.",
