  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.default.views.1.label":
    "Selected records",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.default.views.2.label":
    "All items reference",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.description":
    "A category selection becomes a shared filter strip that reaches some views and stops at an unsubscribed view. Each subscribed view recalculates from the same retained records while the independent view keeps its full denominator.",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.distinction":
    "Linked-parameter-rehearsal applies affine equations to quantities. This applies an equality predicate to row membership across explicit view subscriptions and preserves an independent reference denominator.",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.domains.0":
    "Scoped dashboard filtering",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.goodFor.0":
    "Explain global dashboard filter subscriptions",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.goodFor.1":
    "Contrast filtered views with an unchanged all-records reference",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.intent":
    "Show which views inherit a shared row-selection condition.",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.motionBeats.0":
    "Reveal the schematic scene.",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.motionBeats.1":
    "A category selection becomes a shared filter strip that reaches some views and stops at an unsubscribed view. Each subscribed view recalculates from the same retained records while the independent view keeps its full denominator.",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.motionBeats.2":
    "Place the selected category in its source socket.",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.motionBeats.3":
    "Mask nonmatching records only in subscribed views and derive their totals.",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.motionBeats.4":
    "Hold the complete resolved relationship.",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.motionBeats.5":
    "The outer stock envelope fades to the same opaque ground.",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.name":
    "One filter changes only the subscribed views",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.notFor.0":
    "Only one global equality filter is shown; local filters, complex joins and SQL wrapping are outside scope.",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.notFor.1":
    "Counts are record counts, not unique people unless the author supplies that grain.",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.notFor.2":
    "No causal change in the underlying records is implied.",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.notFor.3":
    "No JSX, functions, URLs or external fetch in props. The animation is an authored explanation, not actual document extraction or product evidence.",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.notFor.4":
    "Every sum uses metric.valueUnit and every row count uses metric.countUnit. The same value measure is used in every subscribed and unsubscribed view.",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.notFor.5":
    "Authored prose and schematic context are the author's responsibility. Runtime validation checks structural bounds and numeric, reference and geometry constraints, without classifying natural-language claims.",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.notFor.6":
    "Category keys preserve exact whitespace. Whitespace is shown using distinct literal-data marks. Record and view IDs allow empty strings and are bounded to 12 characters.",
  "motionAtlas.filter-subscription-scope.prompt":
    "Use Motion Atlas One filter changes only the subscribed views (filter-subscription-scope) to show which views inherit a shared row-selection condition. Supply approved authored content before making claims.",
