    "Learner C",
  "motionAtlas.fraction-material-translation.default.representations.2.materialLabel":
    "Shaded board",
  "motionAtlas.fraction-material-translation.description":
    "Learners demonstrate the same fictional lesson using folded paper, counters, and a shaded board. The objects change while the mathematical relationship stays constant.",
  "motionAtlas.fraction-material-translation.distinction":
    "Each material undergoes a different physical operation that preserves an exact mathematical relationship. This is neither relabeled comparison cards nor a branching workflow that sorts learners into fixed ability tracks.",
