    "Reveal one learner and surface per chosen material, facing the shared prompt.",
  "motionAtlas.fraction-material-translation.motionBeats.1":
    "Fold equal paper parts, gather equal counters and shade equal board cells using the same fraction.",
  "motionAtlas.fraction-material-translation.motionBeats.2":
    "Briefly align selected part rows and move only the work surfaces into the supplied comparison arrangement.",
  "motionAtlas.fraction-material-translation.motionBeats.3":
    "Hold distinct learners, materials and the common fraction through the shared fade.",
  "motionAtlas.fraction-material-translation.name":
    "One fraction, several ways to show it",
  "motionAtlas.fraction-material-translation.notFor.0":
    "Numerator means selected equal parts and denominator means all equal parts of that representation. The default is 1 of 2 in each material, not 3 of 6 learners.",
  "motionAtlas.fraction-material-translation.notFor.1":
    "Counter groups and board partitions are generated from the fraction denominator. No independent part-count input can contradict it.",
  "motionAtlas.fraction-material-translation.notFor.2":
    "Representation choices do not diagnose learning styles or prove superior learning outcomes. The sequence does not rank learners.",
