    "Reveal one learner and work surface per supplied representation facing a shared fraction prompt. Animate only the chosen materials: folded paper divides into equal parts, counters gather into equal units, and shaded-board cells select their authored fraction. Every representation selects the same numerator out of the same denominator. Briefly align corresponding selected parts without merging or ranking learners. Hold the supplied representations and common fraction, then use the shared fade.",
