  "motionAtlas.journal-receipts.description":
    "A retained journal folds open when a connection returns. Matching acknowledgments settle onto its entries while any unacknowledged entries keep their pending tabs.",
  "motionAtlas.journal-receipts.distinction":
    "Packet-stream depicts movement; this depicts identity-matched acknowledgments changing the physical condition of a retained journal. Source-merge combines sources, whereas the original entries remain in place and a matching receipt closes each obligation.",
  "motionAtlas.journal-receipts.domains.0": "Acknowledgment and retention",
