  "motionAtlas.journal-receipts.motionBeats.1":
    "Reveal a compact accordion journal with one folded tab per pending entry. As the connection caption changes, unfold the journal just enough to expose each identifier. Authored receipt halves emerge from a separate acknowledgment pocket and register precisely against matching journal tabs; the paired tabs flatten into the page, leaving unpaired tabs raised. Hold on the visibly retained journal with only the supplied receipts closed, then fade to the shared opaque ground.",
  "motionAtlas.journal-receipts.motionBeats.2":
    "The completed authored state remains held.",
  "motionAtlas.journal-receipts.name": "Receipts Close the Journal",
  "motionAtlas.journal-receipts.notFor.0":
    "One supplied receipt closes exactly one entry. A missing receipt means acknowledgment is absent from this illustration, not that remote processing failed.",
  "motionAtlas.journal-receipts.notFor.1":
    "No retransmission, conflict resolution, deduplication guarantee, or exactly-once delivery claim is implied.",
