    "Two small tables align on equal keys and zip their matched rows together. Unmatched rows remain visibly distinct, making the selected join rule understandable.",
  "motionAtlas.keyed-row-zipper.distinction":
    "Unlike schema-mapping, the relation is between records with equal key values rather than corresponding field names. Unlike source-merge, unmatched rows and the selected join rule determine the result.",
