  "motionAtlas.map-cluster-unfold.creativeDirection":
    "React/SVG 960x600 canvas, shared palette, deterministic 180 frames at 30fps. This is schematic local geography with no real basemap. Frames 0-12 reveal. Frames 13-52 draw all points on a schematic map. Frames 53-82 contract members into their supplied cluster centers with derived count labels. Frames 82-99 hold the exact grouped positions and visible counts. Stationary coincident locations retain count badges throughout movement. Frames 99-139 expand the same identities back to their original points while a total ledger stays fixed. Hold at frames 140-165; fade to the same opaque ground at frames 166-179 for an editorial loop.",
  "motionAtlas.map-cluster-unfold.default.clusters.0.label": "West cluster",
  "motionAtlas.map-cluster-unfold.default.clusters.1.label": "East cluster",
