    "Frames 12..38 show four silhouettes with empty appointment marks beside their homes. Frames 39..114 animate one worker making the authored phone or doorstep contacts; a booking tab folds onto a calendar for one person, while only a documented attendee walks back through the clinic door. Frames 115..167 hold everyone in a distinct final state with the original group total; fade to ground by frame 179.",
