  "motionAtlas.offline-ledger.description":
    "A local notebook continues accepting entries while its connection indicator goes quiet. Every new entry leaves a retained impression in the device's storage drawer.",
  "motionAtlas.offline-ledger.distinction":
    "Unlike status-cycle, the useful operation visibly continues after a dependency disappears. The page-to-drawer impressions depict local retention without a connection graph, packet stream, or new row of cards.",
