  "motionAtlas.offline-ledger.goodFor.4":
    "Explain keeping the original document beside extracted data",
  "motionAtlas.offline-ledger.goodFor.5": "Show local-only document storage",
  "motionAtlas.offline-ledger.intent":
    "Show that losing a connection does not have to interrupt the work already supported on a device.",
  "motionAtlas.offline-ledger.motionBeats.0":
    "The authored setup is established.",
  "motionAtlas.offline-ledger.motionBeats.1":
    "Within the six-second envelope, reveal a notebook held inside a device outline. At the first entry, the small connection arc gently collapses and the supplied offline caption appears; the writing strokes continue at the same cadence. Each entry presses a matching impression into a shallow local drawer directly beneath the page. Hold on the completed page and its retained impressions with the connection still unavailable, then fade both to the opaque ground without depicting data loss.",
  "motionAtlas.offline-ledger.motionBeats.2":
    "The completed authored state remains held.",
  "motionAtlas.offline-ledger.name": "Work Keeps Its Place",
  "motionAtlas.offline-ledger.notFor.0":
    "The number of impressions equals entries.length and is an authored example count, not storage capacity or throughput.",
  "motionAtlas.offline-ledger.notFor.1":
    "This scene does not imply that every product action works offline, that data is encrypted, or that remote synchronization has occurred.",
  "motionAtlas.offline-ledger.notFor.2":
    "No duration on screen represents actual outage duration or save latency. Notebook casing is a metaphor and should not be described as proof of digital persistence.",
  "motionAtlas.offline-ledger.notFor.3":
    "Show only the illustrated local operation. Do not imply that authentication, sharing, remote queries, or every product capability continues without a connection.",
  "motionAtlas.offline-ledger.notFor.4":
    "A stored impression does not establish backup, encryption, eviction resistance, unlimited storage, synchronization, or zero device energy and maintenance cost.",
  "motionAtlas.offline-ledger.notFor.5":
    "A derived table cannot reconstruct the original PDF page. Local retention is distinct from remote backup.",
