    "Two alternatives align around the same question, then matched attributes connect across a center divider. One authored difference receives a final underline without declaring an automatic winner.",
  "motionAtlas.paired-contrast.distinction":
    "Unlike stagger-cards, the action is the synchronized alignment and expansion of matched differences. Unlike bar-race, it compares supplied qualitative attributes without ranking or invented numeric scores.",
