  "motionAtlas.pdf-grid-reconstruction.creativeDirection":
    "960x600 React/SVG, shared palette, frame-driven 180 frames at 30fps. Frames 0-12 reveal the scene. Frames 13-55 draw the selected evidence: tagged-cell outlines, ruling lines or whitespace corridors. Frames 56-105 register the supplied text items inside their cells. Frames 106-139 unfold an equal-sized grid beside the page with every cell still linked to its source position. Hold the resolved relationship at frames 140-165, then fade to the same opaque ground at 166-179. Reset is editorial.",
