  "motionAtlas.pdf-nearest-label-review.creativeDirection":
    "960x600 React/SVG, shared palette, frame-driven 180 frames at 30fps. Frames 0-12 reveal the scene. Frames 13-50 reveal one numeric token and two nearby label boxes. Frames 51-95 extend distance guides from the token to both boxes. Frames 96-139 show either the reviewer choosing one label or an unresolved bracket retaining both candidates; the extracted row carries the same source position. Hold the resolved relationship at frames 140-165, then fade to the same opaque ground at 166-179. Reset is editorial.",
