  "motionAtlas.pdf-nearest-label-review.description":
    "A figure on a schematic page measures its distance to two possible labels. A close runner-up leaves the pairing flagged until an authored human choice identifies the intended label.",
  "motionAtlas.pdf-nearest-label-review.distinction":
    "Unlike keyed-row-zipper, labels are associated by spatial evidence rather than equal keys. Unlike location-uncertainty-boundary, uncertainty concerns document interpretation, not a position on Earth.",
