    "Operation label",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.creativeDirection":
    "Frames 0-11 reveal a work surface, a bounded record strip, and an empty tool socket on the 960x600 canvas. Frames 12-55 bring the named utility beside the socket and display the supplied decision. For install, frames 56-90 seat the utility and align its counting stencil with the unchanged category field. Frames 91-132 draw one tally mark per retained record into its category, resolving compact bars on a common integer scale. For defer, the utility stays beside the empty socket and no tally appears. Hold the retained records, decision, and resulting capability through frame 167, then use the shared opaque exit through frame 179. All movement is frame-driven React/SVG at 30fps.",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.default.categories.0.label": "Books",
