    "Demo count utility",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.default.utility.operationLabel":
    "Count by category",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.description":
    "An optional utility seats into a workspace only after an authored installation choice. Its category-count stencil then reads the retained records and reveals one derived tally, making added capability distinct from data replacement.",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.distinction":
    "Unlike dashboard-slot-assembly, a new operation becomes available before it acts on retained data. Unlike pipeline-step-splice, no processing chain is rewired. The socketed stencil visibly derives a result from the existing records rather than introducing a renamed card collection.",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.domains.0": "Modular capability",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.goodFor.0":
    "Explain an optional extension adding one task-specific capability",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.goodFor.1":
    "Show a team choosing a reusable utility without replacing its dataset",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.goodFor.2":
    "Introduce a plugin concept before a verified installation demonstration",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.intent":
    "Show that a chosen extension adds an operation over retained data.",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.motionBeats.0":
    "Reveal retained records and empty socket.",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.motionBeats.1":
    "Present utility and authored choice.",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.motionBeats.2":
    "Install seats one utility; defer leaves the socket empty.",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.motionBeats.3":
    "Installed stencil counts every retained record.",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.motionBeats.4":
    "Hold the chosen outcome.",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.motionBeats.5": "Shared opaque exit.",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.name":
    "Fit one new tool to existing data",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.notFor.0":
    "One optional utility and one fixed tally operation. No executable code, external URLs, marketplace requests, dependency resolution, or security review occur.",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.notFor.1":
    "The sum of category counts must equal records.length and each record is counted exactly once. Installation never adds, removes, or edits source records.",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.notFor.2":
    "The default is fictional. This is not evidence of a shipped plugin system, one-click installation, compatibility with arbitrary data, or a particular installation time.",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.notFor.3":
    "The defer outcome produces no result and no installed-state marker. Zero-count categories remain visible.",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.notFor.4":
    "No medical prediction, automated risk assessment, or clinical decision is represented by the utility.",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.notFor.5":
    "Supplied prose meaning, fictional status and agreement with structured choices are authoring responsibilities. Runtime validation enforces structure, numeric bounds, identities and references.",
  "motionAtlas.plugin-capability-install.prompt":
    'Use Motion Atlas "Fit one new tool to existing data" (plugin-capability-install) as a conceptual graphic. Show that a chosen extension adds an operation over retained data. Replace fictional examples with approved authored content before making product claims.',
