  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.creativeDirection":
    "Over six seconds, contributors tip small stacks of individually marked demo-credit tokens into a transparent shared tray. Earmarked tokens retain their destination ribbon; flexible tokens retain a distinct flexible marker. A community coordinator slides the configured tokens into labeled funding-request envelopes, preserving donor marks and respecting every earmark, while any unallocated tokens stay in the tray. Set each funded envelope upright with contributor marks visible above its edge, and hold the allocation totals alongside the remaining pool without transforming money into goods before the shared opaque exit fade. No token changes value, duplicates, or loses attribution.",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.default.contributions.0.donorLabel":
    "Example donor A",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.default.contributions.0.mark": "A",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.default.contributions.1.donorLabel":
    "Example donor B",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.default.contributions.1.mark": "B",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.default.contributions.2.donorLabel":
    "Example donor C",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.default.contributions.2.mark": "C",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.default.labels.allocated":
    "Allocated to request",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.default.labels.coordinator":
    "Community coordinator",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.default.labels.earmarked": "Earmarked",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.default.labels.flexible": "Flexible",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.default.labels.pool": "Shared pool",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.default.labels.remaining":
    "Still in pool",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.default.labels.unit": "Demo credits",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.default.requests.0.label":
    "Example food transport",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.default.requests.1.label":
    "Example shelter access",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.default.scenarioCaption":
    "Fictional funds and allocations",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.description":
    "Contributor-marked demo credits gather in a transparent shared tray before being allocated to named funding requests. Earmarked credits keep their destination restriction, flexible credits can support different requests, and every unit remains attributable.",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.distinction":
    "Unlike source-merge, pooling is followed by a constrained physical allocation into separate funding requests, and contributor identity survives the entire sequence. The hero action is sorting and retaining attributed, restricted units, not convergence toward one destination or a fundraising counter.",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.domains.0":
    "Participatory resource allocation",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.goodFor.0":
    "Explain earmarked and flexible contributions in a fictional pooled fund",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.goodFor.1":
    "Show how donor attribution survives shared resource allocation",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.goodFor.2":
    "Connect a jointly managed pool to specific funding requests without implying delivered outcomes",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.intent":
    "Show that pooling resources can preserve both donor attribution and restrictions on their use.",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.motionBeats.0":
    "Reveal the donor labels and individually attributed credits.",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.motionBeats.1":
    "Tip the exact credits into a transparent shared tray.",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.motionBeats.2":
    "The coordinator slides each configured request batch on a clear scoop, withdraws the support and sets the envelopes upright.",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.motionBeats.3":
    "Hold all donor marks, earmarks, allocation totals and residual credits.",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.motionBeats.4":
    "Return to the opaque ground through the shared envelope.",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.name":
    "Pool support, preserve its purpose",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.notFor.0":
    "Every token is exactly one fictional demo credit; total contributions equal total allocations plus the visibly retained pool. Totals and residuals are derived, never separately authored.",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.notFor.1":
    "Earmarked credits cannot move to another request. Flexible credits may be split only as explicitly configured, and donor marks remain visible throughout.",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.notFor.2":
    "Funding envelopes represent planned spending allocations only. No conversion into goods, people served, delivery completion, or impact is implied.",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.notFor.3":
    "The scene is a small authored example, not accounting software, a fundraising transaction, a financial recommendation, or real donor reporting.",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.notFor.4":
    "Literal donor whitespace is shown with styled whitespace marks; original input remains exact.",
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.prompt":
    "Pool support, preserve its purpose. Show that pooling resources can preserve both donor attribution and restrictions on their use.",
