  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.creativeDirection":
    "Frames 12..42 reveal the owner with a bounded collection at the source tool. Frames 43..92 lift one labeled copy of each artifact into a single portable folio while originals stay anchored in place. Frames 93..130 let the owner carry the folio to the destination. For accepted, open it and place each same-ID copy on the destination surface. For awaiting-open, retain the closed folio without a success mark. Frames 131..167 hold both tool labels, the owner and the actual transfer state. Do not animate format conversion or infer compatibility. Use deterministic frame-driven React/SVG at 960x600, 180 frames and 30 fps, with the shared palette. Reveal during frames 0..11 and fade to the common opaque ground during frames 168..179.",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.default.artifacts.0.label":
    "Project notes",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.default.artifacts.1.label":
    "Activity sheet",
