    "Awaiting opening",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.default.labels.portable": "Portable work",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.default.labels.received":
    "Opened at destination",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.default.ownerLabel": "Project owner",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.default.tools.destination": "Tool B",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.default.tools.source": "Tool A",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.description":
    "A person packs copies of their work into a portable folio and brings it to another workbench. Artifact identities survive the transfer, and the original work remains visible at the source.",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.distinction":
    "Unlike report-page-bind, a heterogeneous existing work collection changes tool without being rewritten into a new report. Unlike custody-transfer, ownership stays with the same person and source originals remain present. Unlike sealed-handoff, confidentiality is not the explanatory purpose.",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.domains.0": "Editorial illustration",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.goodFor.0":
    "Explain ownership across a change of tool",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.goodFor.1":
    "Illustrate portability as a response to vendor dependence",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.goodFor.2":
    "Keep source retention separate from destination acceptance",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.intent":
    "Show that changing a tool should not erase the person's work.",
