    "Carry the loaded folio and open it only when accepted.",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.motionBeats.3":
    "Hold originals and the actual transfer state.",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.name": "Take the work to another tool",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.notFor.0":
    "The portable folio illustrates a portability principle. It is not evidence of an implemented export or import feature.",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.notFor.1":
    "No file format, schema conversion, compatibility, migration completeness or vendor policy is demonstrated.",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.notFor.2":
    "Source and destination copies represent the same unique work IDs and must not inflate a unique-artifact total.",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.notFor.3":
    "Supplied prose is preserved. Fictional framing, evidence, and agreement between wording and selected states are authoring responsibilities. Runtime validation enforces structural bounds and explicit cross-field rules.",
  "motionAtlas.portable-work-transfer.prompt":
    "Show that changing a tool should not erase the person's work.",
