    "Show one learner using a ruler to place a labeled measurement on a practice sheet at a classroom desk. Slide the surrounding furniture into a simple workshop arrangement while retaining the learner and the first marked sheet at the side. Repeat the same ruler placement and marking gesture on the chosen work material, then hold the two measured artifacts together. Fade to the shared background.",
