  "motionAtlas.predicate-pushdown-boundary.creativeDirection":
    "960x600 React/SVG, shared palette, frame-driven 180 frames at 30fps. Frames 0-12 reveal the scene. Frames 13-50 show a query predicate arriving at the source. Frames 51-95 close source gates for nonmatching rows. Frames 96-139 move only matching row copies across the boundary while the full source remains intact. Hold the resolved relationship at frames 140-165, then fade to the same opaque ground at 166-179. Reset is editorial.",
