    "React/SVG 960x600 canvas, shared palette, deterministic 180 frames at 30fps. This is schematic local geography with no real basemap. Frames 0-12 reveal. Frames 13-50 reveal source values as equal-area tile counts. Frames 51-110 reshape each tile bundle into a circle of matching total area. Frames 111-139 overlay a reference-radius ruler and keep the area/value legend visible. Hold at frames 140-165; fade to the same opaque ground at frames 166-179 for an editorial loop.",
