    "No live geography, online routing, JSX, functions, URLs, private records or external requests. Maps are schematic local plans; no real-world inference follows.",
  "motionAtlas.proportional-symbol-area.notFor.4":
    "The fixed plot is 400x400 rendered pixels. Map normalized centers to (x*4,y*4). For each radius sqrt(value*areaPerUnit/pi), require r<=x*4<=400-r and r<=y*4<=400-r. Every center separation must be >=r_i+r_j+12 rendered pixels. Reject clipping and overlaps.",
  "motionAtlas.proportional-symbol-area.notFor.5":
    "Authored prose and schematic context are the author's responsibility. Runtime validation checks structural bounds and numeric, reference and geometry constraints, without classifying natural-language claims.",
  "motionAtlas.proportional-symbol-area.prompt":
    "Use Motion Atlas Make symbol area match the value (proportional-symbol-area) to make quantity proportional to symbol area rather than radius. Supply approved authored content before making claims.",
