  "motionAtlas.prose-measurement-ledger.creativeDirection":
    "960x600 React/SVG, shared palette, frame-driven 180 frames at 30fps. Frames 0-12 reveal the scene. Frames 13-55 underline the supplied sentence fragments with distinct patterns. Frames 56-110 move copies of those exact fragments into labeled observation slots. Frames 111-139 hold the original sentence above the structured row and keep the qualifier visible. Hold the resolved relationship at frames 140-165, then fade to the same opaque ground at 166-179. Reset is editorial.",
