  "motionAtlas.prose-measurement-ledger.description":
    "An authored sentence separates into subject, metric, value, unit and period strips that assemble into an observation row. Uncertainty qualifiers remain attached to the value.",
  "motionAtlas.prose-measurement-ledger.distinction":
    "Unlike word-reveal, the action changes a sentence into an observation schema with explicit semantic roles, not merely typography. Value and unit cannot detach from period or qualifier.",
  "motionAtlas.prose-measurement-ledger.domains.0": "Observation extraction",
  "motionAtlas.prose-measurement-ledger.goodFor.0":
    "Explain extracting structured observations from prose",
  "motionAtlas.prose-measurement-ledger.goodFor.1":
    "Preserve units, reporting periods and approximation qualifiers",
