    "Move selected semantic fragment copies into labeled observation slots.",
  "motionAtlas.prose-measurement-ledger.motionBeats.3":
    "Hold the original sentence, all extracted fields, qualifier and independent method/review status. The outer renderer fades at 166..179.",
  "motionAtlas.prose-measurement-ledger.name":
    "Carry the unit and qualifier with the number",
  "motionAtlas.prose-measurement-ledger.notFor.0":
    "No automatic language understanding or verified factual extraction is performed.",
  "motionAtlas.prose-measurement-ledger.notFor.1":
    "One sentence and one observation only; multi-clause ambiguities require a longer scene.",
  "motionAtlas.prose-measurement-ledger.notFor.2":
    "Method and confidence are separate. A model-produced row is not inherently correct.",
  "motionAtlas.prose-measurement-ledger.notFor.3":
    "No JSX, functions, URLs or external fetch in props. The animation is an authored explanation, not actual document extraction or product evidence.",
  "motionAtlas.prose-measurement-ledger.notFor.4":
    "Every output field derives only from its corresponding role fragment by the specified substring and whitespace trim. Preserve casing; numeric value alone converts the exact selected plain-decimal substring with Number. No independent normalized-row prop may contradict the source.",
  "motionAtlas.prose-measurement-ledger.notFor.5":
    "All IDs are unique and exactly one of each semantic role occurs. Concatenated UTF-16 text length <=110. Semantic offsets are integers with 0<=start<end<=fragment.text.length and trimmed selections are 1..20 UTF-16 units. Connectors have start=end=0. The value selection is a finite plain decimal, optional minus, no exponent or separators. Method and review state remain independent. Source and every output value derive from exact authored fragments, never independent output props.",
  "motionAtlas.prose-measurement-ledger.notFor.6":
    "Prose meaning is an author responsibility. Runtime validation enforces structural bounds, exact references and numeric/geometric rules.",
  "motionAtlas.prose-measurement-ledger.prompt":
    'Use Motion Atlas "Carry the unit and qualifier with the number" (prose-measurement-ledger) as an authored conceptual explanation. Preserve the context that gives a number meaning. Supply approved content before making product claims.',
