  "motionAtlas.protected-work-boundary.creativeDirection":
    "Frames 12..38 reveal one fixed strip of equal time blocks containing existing commitments and protected rest, learning or community time. Frames 39..76 bring a new request toward its named protected block. The worker lifts the request away before it covers that block. Frames 77..130 place it in the deferred tray or the supplied empty work slot. Frames 131..167 hold the unchanged protected blocks, retained commitments and visible request disposition. Never stretch the strip or accelerate existing work to create room. Use deterministic frame-driven React/SVG at 960x600, 180 frames and 30 fps, with the shared palette. Reveal during frames 0..11 and fade to the common opaque ground during frames 168..179.",
