    "Frames 12-40 hold a summary strip resting over a short stack of source sheets. During frames 40-104, the summary lifts in place and the source sheets fan out with their text kept upright. The selected source rises, its excerpt receives a narrow underline, and a citation tab aligns with the summary edge. Hold the statement and source passage side by side through frame 166, then return to the opaque ground.",
