    "960x600 React/SVG, shared palette, frame-driven 180 frames at 30fps. Frames 0-12 reveal the scene. Frames 13-55 outline selected cells in the live table. Frames 56-95 copy them into a separate snapshot frame with a revision label. Frames 96-139 alter only the authored live cell, preserving the frozen publication and its revision. Hold the resolved relationship at frames 140-165, then fade to the same opaque ground at 166-179. Reset is editorial.",
