  "motionAtlas.publication-snapshot-slice.description":
    "An author chooses a bounded row and column slice, which is copied into a revision-labeled snapshot. Later source edits change the workspace table while the published snapshot stays at its explicit revision.",
  "motionAtlas.publication-snapshot-slice.distinction":
    "Disclosure-aperture selects fields for one handoff. This also freezes a revision and shows a later live edit diverging from that immutable publication, rather than implying a live share.",
  "motionAtlas.publication-snapshot-slice.domains.0": "Publication boundaries",
