  "motionAtlas.queue-relief.creativeDirection":
    "Frames 0..12 reveal a queue corridor and named service slots. During 12..54, every supplied item arrives and only initially open slots accept work, making the waiting line visible. Keep initial service items occupied until the capacity expansion beat so a backlog remains visible. During 54..90, the additional slots unfold from closed outlines into usable bays. During 90..138, waiting items enter those bays without changing their original order and emerge into a completed tray. Hold the emptied queue and all completed items through frame 168, then fade to the opaque ground by 179. The hero action is the release of accumulated work after capacity changes.",
