  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.default.unitLabel": "work units",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.description":
    "Independent work ribbons reach a shared readiness latch. Completed branches release their own pins, but the common result can pass only after every required branch is ready.",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.distinction":
    "Combines a parallel-completion barrier and a readiness gate. Unlike status-cycle, the action depends on all independent branch states and may remain blocked; an early completion cannot release it.",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.domains.0": "Editorial explanation",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.goodFor.0":
    "Explain an all-participants readiness condition",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.goodFor.1":
    "Illustrate coordinated publication or a stage crew's agreed cue",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.goodFor.2":
    "Show why one unresolved prerequisite keeps a shared action on hold",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.goodFor.3":
    "Explaining an all-of dependency before publication",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.goodFor.4":
    "Showing independent checks that must all finish",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.goodFor.5":
    "Introducing parallel work followed by one coordinated handoff",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.goodFor.6":
    "Explain full versus partial offline readiness",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.goodFor.7":
    "Show one missing dependency keeping an action unavailable",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.intent":
    "Explain a shared action that waits for every named participant's readiness.",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.motionBeats.0":
    "Reveal stable ribbon order and the common latch.",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.motionBeats.1":
    "Relative work completes ready ribbons while unready pins remain.",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.motionBeats.2":
    "Open only when all pins have withdrawn and release the result.",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.motionBeats.3":
    "Hold the completed ribbons and released or blocked gate.",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.name": "Wait for every required branch",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.notFor.0":
    "The condition is all supplied participants, not a majority, weighted vote, or consensus algorithm.",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.notFor.1":
    "Readiness and ordering are authored. The small latch test and reveal are illustrative timing, not measured coordination latency.",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.notFor.2":
    "A blocked final state is valid. Waiting must not be styled as a participant's fault or as proof of a failure outside the example.",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.notFor.3":
    "The default branches and work quantities are fictional.",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.notFor.4":
    "Work units establish relative authored timing only; the six-second playback is not a duration forecast.",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.notFor.5":
    "Every branch is required. An unready branch remains incomplete and keeps the latch closed. Quorum and optional checks require another scene.",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.notFor.6":
    "A cached dependency list does not establish that every other product capability works offline.",
  "motionAtlas.readiness-latch.prompt":
    "Explain a shared action that waits for every named participant's readiness.",
