  "motionAtlas.recipient-confirmed-handover.creativeDirection":
    "Within six seconds, reveal offered goods on a delivery table and the household representative indicating their configured selections. They pull exactly the selected units across a counting mat into their basket, one visible object per unit; untouched quantities stay on the delivery side. The chosen-quantity rows on a receipt fill from those actual movements, then the recipient acknowledges that specific list and keeps one copy. Hold the counted basket, retained goods, and receipt together before the shared opaque exit fade. The physical choice and counting occupy most of the shot; acknowledgement is only the final beat.",
