  "motionAtlas.referral-return-acknowledgement.creativeDirection":
    "Frames 12..40 reveal the referring clinic with three people and three matching referral slips. Frames 41..113 let only attended people cross to the receiving service, then send a returned acknowledgement slip back for only the supplied completed loop. Frames 114..167 hold one returned loop, one attended-but-unacknowledged case, and one waiting case in their physical locations; fade to ground by frame 179.",
