    "Hill clinic",
  "motionAtlas.referral-return-acknowledgement.description":
    "People move from a referring clinic to a receiving service, while an acknowledgement travels back independently. Attendance and a closed communication loop remain visibly distinct.",
  "motionAtlas.referral-return-acknowledgement.distinction":
    "Unlike node-traversal or data-pipeline, person movement and document return are independent motions traveling in opposite directions. The resolved view can contain attendance without a returned acknowledgement.",
