    "A proposed label settles into a central selection slot beneath a criterion. A small strike crosses its selection marker, then the option slides into a left-side rejected position as its reason appears. The replacement enters the vacated slot from the right, receives a selection bracket, and holds with its rationale and the original choice still readable before the shared fade.",
