  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.creativeDirection":
    "960x600 React/SVG, shared palette, frame-driven 180 frames at 30fps. Frames 0-12 reveal the scene. Frames 13-55 reveal repeated heading blocks with their field labels. Frames 56-105 line up equal labels vertically and rotate the block organization into a compact row-based table. Frames 106-139 hold each block beside its row with an explicit missing cell. Hold the resolved relationship at frames 140-165, then fade to the same opaque ground at 166-179. Reset is editorial.",
