  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.default.fields.1.label": "Need",
  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.default.missingLabel": "Not stated",
  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.description":
    "Repeated labeled paragraphs unfold into rows of one table. Shared run-in labels become columns, and an absent section stays missing instead of shifting neighboring text into its place.",
  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.distinction":
    "Unlike schema-mapping, the field labels already match. The animation reveals a tabular structure concealed by repeated prose layout and preserves absent cells.",
  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.domains.0":
    "Repeated structure extraction",
  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.goodFor.0":
    "Explain turning repeated labeled sections into a table",
  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.goodFor.1":
    "Preserve absent fields during document extraction",
  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.intent":
    "Expose tabular structure inside repeated prose sections.",
  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.motionBeats.0": "Reveal the context.",
  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.motionBeats.1":
    "Establish repeated heading blocks and their run-in field labels.",
  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.motionBeats.2":
    "Reorient field-value strips from vertical block stacks into horizontal table rows.",
  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.motionBeats.3":
    "Hold each original block identity beside its row and retain explicit missing cells. The outer renderer fades at 166..179.",
  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.name":
    "Read the same fields across repeated sections",
  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.notFor.0":
    "Authored, exact field alignment only; no inference from headings.",
  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.notFor.1":
    "Does not imply that the original document contained a printed table.",
  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.notFor.2":
    "Multicolumn reading-order ambiguity is excluded from this compact example.",
  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.notFor.3":
    "No JSX, functions, URLs or external fetch in props. The animation is an authored explanation, not actual document extraction or product evidence.",
  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.notFor.4":
    "Fields and blocks each have unique exact IDs, including at most one empty ID. Block IDs and field IDs have maximum length 12, no minimum. Every block has exactly one cell for each existing field ID, independent of cell array order. Null means missing and never zero. Output columns follow fields array order, rows follow blocks array order. Duplicate headings remain distinct by ID.",
  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.notFor.5":
    "Prose meaning is an author responsibility. Runtime validation enforces structural bounds, exact references and numeric/geometric rules.",
  "motionAtlas.repeating-blocks-to-table.prompt":
    'Use Motion Atlas "Read the same fields across repeated sections" (repeating-blocks-to-table) as an authored conceptual explanation. Expose tabular structure inside repeated prose sections. Supply approved content before making product claims.',
