    "Choose the arrangement of unfolded paper ballots. Stacks or rows; both retain one visible unit per ballot.",
  "motionAtlas.resident-budget-ballots.creativeDirection":
    "Begin with a small row of anonymous residents and a project display. Each resident marks one paper behind a short screen, then places it in the ballot box or keeps an abstention slip. The box opens and the same papers unfold into stacks under their chosen project symbols. Hold every cast ballot, the abstention slips and derived totals. Do not transform votes into money or automatically crown a winner.",
