  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.creativeDirection":
    "Over six seconds, reveal the supplied opening stock as individual objects on a cutaway shelf. The retailer points to the empty spaces and places an order slip on the counter; a small delivery trolley arrives with exactly the incoming objects, which the retailer places into those spaces. A shopper then selects the authored purchase quantity while the remaining stock stays visible. Hold the final shelf and basket, with opening plus incoming minus selected quantities conserved, then fade to the opaque ground.",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.default.goods.0.label":
    "Example grain",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.default.goods.1.label":
    "Example beans",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.default.labels.delivery":
    "Example replenishment",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.default.labels.order":
    "Restock request",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.default.labels.retailer":
    "Example retailer",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.default.labels.shopper":
    "Example shopper",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.default.labels.unit":
    "Illustrative items",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.default.scenarioCaption":
    "Fictional shop and quantities",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.description":
    "A retailer notices empty shelf spaces, receives a small replenishment, and makes the goods available for a shopper to choose. Physical inventory changes connect retail supply to usable assistance.",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.distinction":
    "Unlike data-pipeline, quantities physically leave a vehicle, occupy shelf slots, and move into a customer basket. Unlike household-market-choice, the main action is restoring availability before the purchase, with explicit conservation of inventory.",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.domains.0": "Retail availability",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.goodFor.0":
    "Explain why cash assistance also depends on stocked local shops",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.goodFor.1":
    "Illustrate a fictional retailer replenishment cycle",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.goodFor.2":
    "Make the relationship between demand and physical availability visible",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.intent":
    "Show that purchasing choice depends on goods reaching and remaining on the shelf.",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.motionBeats.0":
    "Reveal opening stock. Retailer points to gaps and places the request.",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.motionBeats.1":
    "Arrive with exact incoming units and hand-load every shelf space.",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.motionBeats.2":
    "Shopper selects each authored purchase and releases it into the basket.",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.motionBeats.3":
    "Hold the exact conserved shelf and basket.",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.motionBeats.4":
    "Return to the opaque ground through the shared envelope.",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.name": "Keep the shelf supplied",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.notFor.0":
    "Every visible product object corresponds to one authored example unit; no real stock, sales, price, or availability data is represented.",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.notFor.1":
    "This animation illustrates an authored sequence, not a demand forecast, inventory optimization system, or guarantee against shortages.",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.notFor.2":
    "Incoming supply and shopper choice are configured separately and validated for feasible quantities; no goods are silently invented.",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.notFor.3":
    "The process is inspired by the relationship between retail supply and cash assistance, without copying agency assets or asserting any measured result.",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.prompt":
    "Keep the shelf supplied. Show that purchasing choice depends on goods reaching and remaining on the shelf.",
  "motionAtlas.retail-shelf-replenishment.tags.0": "retail supply chain",
