  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.creativeDirection":
    "960x600 React/SVG, shared palette, deterministic 180 frames at 30fps. Frames 0-12 reveal the scene. Frames 13-55 lift a copy of the header strip and the authored question card from the device and send both across a clearly labeled boundary to the remote planner, while every row record stays inside the device. Frames 56-100 unfold the returned operation strip inside the device. Frames 101-139 apply its explicit predicate and sum to the local rows; the result stays beside the table. Hold the resolved meaning during frames 140-165. Frames 166-179 return to the same opaque ground for a six-second loop; reset is editorial.",
