    "Fictional example",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.default.request.planLabel":
    "Filter North, then sum Items",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.default.request.question":
    "Total items for North?",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.description":
    "A table keeps its row records inside a device while its column names and an authored question travel to a remote planner. A query plan returns and selects a result inside the original device.",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.distinction":
    "Unlike pocket-inference, the model is remote. Unlike disclosure-aperture, the shared header is a schema, a plan returns, and computation visibly occurs over retained rows.",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.domains.0": "Editorial illustration",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.goodFor.0":
    "Explain AI query generation without uploading raw row records",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.goodFor.1":
    "Show the difference between remote planning and local execution",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.intent":
    "Separate remote query planning from the location of raw-data execution.",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.motionBeats.0":
    "Send only the supplied question and schema.",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.motionBeats.1":
    "Return the authored operation strip to the device.",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.motionBeats.2":
    "Filter and sum local row values inside the device.",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.motionBeats.3":
    "Hold the local result and retained rows.",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.name":
    "Send the structure, run the question locally",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.notFor.0":
    "This illustrates one metadata-only query mode, not a claim that all AI traffic excludes row data. Questions, schema labels and returned SQL may themselves be sensitive.",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.notFor.1":
    "Optional value discovery, pasted text, samples and PDF model assistance are separate boundary crossings and are deliberately absent from this mode.",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.notFor.2":
    "The plan is authored, not inferred by an LLM. Selected membership and sum are calculated from the supplied rows.",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.notFor.3":
    "No real product screen, external fetch, supplied code execution, or measured performance claim. All text is authored; no JSX, functions or URLs in props.",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.notFor.4":
    "Supplied prose is preserved. Fictional framing, evidence, and agreement between wording and selected states are authoring responsibilities. Runtime validation enforces structural bounds and explicit cross-field rules.",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.notFor.5":
    "Exact local cell whitespace uses distinct visible space, tab and newline marks. Repeated rows remain separate occurrences.",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.prompt":
    "Separate remote query planning from the location of raw-data execution.",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.tags.0": "schema-only AI",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.tags.1": "local execution",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.tags.2": "remote planning",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.tags.3": "data minimization",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.tags.4": "query generation",
  "motionAtlas.schema-plan-local-execution.useWhen":
    "Separate remote query planning from the location of raw-data execution.",
