    "Supported and independent practice are alternatives, not a hierarchy of participant worth or ability.",
  "motionAtlas.school-transition-rehearsal.prompt":
    "Open on a learner and companion beside a simple interior containing a locker and a classroom doorway. The learner consults a two-step practice strip, opens the named locker, then approaches the named room. The companion either stays alongside or deliberately stands back for the final step, according to the supplied choice. Hold the learner at the final practice stop with the rehearsal label visible, without changing it to enrolled or attended.",
