    "Show how a learner can practice an unfamiliar school routine before it becomes a daily expectation.",
  "motionAtlas.SchoolLunchTrayComposition.beat.0":
    "Reveal the full learner roster, outlined planned trays and named component legend.",
  "motionAtlas.SchoolLunchTrayComposition.beat.1":
    "Serving spoons place each authored component into its compartment in four bounded twelve-frame turns. Empty subsets receive no food.",
  "motionAtlas.SchoolLunchTrayComposition.beat.2":
    "Slide every tray 24 diagram pixels into its table place, retaining learner identity. When enabled, unfilled compartments receive one neutral outline-width pulse: rise from 1 to 2 pixels during frames 88-92, hold through 100, then return to 1 pixel by 104.",
  "motionAtlas.SchoolLunchTrayComposition.beat.3":
    "Hold the complete-plan numerator over all planned trays through the shared fade.",
