    "The common distance axis from a visible zero origin. Maximum integer 10..100; unit 1..14 characters; all prediction and observation values use this unit and must fit the axis",
  "motionAtlas.shared-experiment-predictions.controls.track.maximum": "maximum",
  "motionAtlas.shared-experiment-predictions.controls.track.unit": "unit",
  "motionAtlas.shared-experiment-predictions.creativeDirection":
    "Reveal a tabletop ramp and a labeled distance track with the supplied learners around it. Each learner places a distinct labeled prediction flag before a single ball is released. The ball travels to the supplied observation position and stops; retain every prediction without scoring or ranking learners. Hold the observed marker and predicted positions together, then fade out before resetting.",
