  "motionAtlas.shared-foundation.creativeDirection":
    "Two labeled structures stand apart with their distinct traits underneath. Their lower edges rise in parallel, exposing matching fragments of a shared foundation phrase. The fragments join into one continuous base spanning both structures, then short supports reconnect each approach to it. The final hold reads as two approaches resting on the same principle before the shared exit.",
