  "motionAtlas.shared-foundation.default.sharedPrinciple":
    "Make the fictional route understandable",
  "motionAtlas.shared-foundation.description":
    "Two different approaches lift to reveal one explicitly shared foundation. Their distinguishing traits remain attached, so commonality does not erase their differences.",
  "motionAtlas.shared-foundation.distinction":
    "Unlike source-merge, the two approaches never collapse into a single output. Unlike a comparison panel, the hero action uncovers and connects one common base while preserving the two distinct identities.",
