    "Apply the same pattern",
  "motionAtlas.shared-jig-preparation.default.labels.example":
    "Fictional preparation example",
  "motionAtlas.shared-jig-preparation.default.labels.prepare":
    "Prepare the guide",
  "motionAtlas.shared-jig-preparation.default.labels.retained":
    "Guide remains reusable",
  "motionAtlas.shared-jig-preparation.default.makerLabel": "Guide maker",
  "motionAtlas.shared-jig-preparation.description":
    "One maker prepares a physical marking guide. The same guide then moves between coworkers, who apply its pattern to their own supplied workpieces while keeping the reusable guide intact.",
  "motionAtlas.shared-jig-preparation.distinction":
    "Unlike contribution-weave, the team does not combine its outputs into one object. Unlike practice-to-work-sample, the reusable artifact itself travels to multiple coworkers. Unlike cache-reuse, different workpieces receive a repeatable procedure rather than repeated requests receiving a stored answer.",
  "motionAtlas.shared-jig-preparation.domains.0": "Editorial illustration",
  "motionAtlas.shared-jig-preparation.goodFor.0":
    "Explain preparatory work that supports teammates",
