    "Prepare one guide that the whole team can reuse",
  "motionAtlas.shared-jig-preparation.notFor.0":
    "No elapsed-time comparison, productivity multiplier or quality improvement is inferred from the choreography.",
  "motionAtlas.shared-jig-preparation.notFor.1":
    "The physical guide is an authored preparation metaphor, not evidence of a particular product workflow or a measured team effect.",
  "motionAtlas.shared-jig-preparation.notFor.2":
    "All workpieces exist at the start. Applying a pattern creates marks, not extra material or workers.",
  "motionAtlas.shared-jig-preparation.notFor.3":
    "Supplied prose is preserved. Fictional framing, evidence, and agreement between wording and selected states are authoring responsibilities. Runtime validation enforces structural bounds and explicit cross-field rules.",
  "motionAtlas.shared-jig-preparation.prompt":
    "Make the benefit of shared preparation concrete without inventing a performance multiplier.",
