  "motionAtlas.shared-workshop-booking.notFor.1":
    "No revenue, employment or productivity outcome is implied by a booked or illustrated equipment turn.",
  "motionAtlas.shared-workshop-booking.notFor.2":
    "A null agreed slot stays unresolved and never receives a use gesture.",
  "motionAtlas.shared-workshop-booking.prompt":
    "Show one sewing machine beside a compact time ruler, with the supplied participant request strips overlapping above it. The participants slide only the authored changed strips into their agreed non-overlapping windows and place agreement tabs. A short physical turn at the same machine is shown for each booked participant in order, with the others' named strips remaining visible. Hold the one machine and the agreed schedule; unresolved requests stay above the ruler rather than masquerading as bookings.",
