    "React/SVG 960x600 canvas, shared palette, deterministic 180 frames at 30fps. This is schematic local geography with no real basemap. Frames 0-12 reveal. Frames 13-50 draw the grid over stationary points. Frames 51-110 slide one count token from each point into its cell ledger. Frames 111-139 shade cells by derived count while retaining faint original positions. Hold at frames 140-165; fade to the same opaque ground at frames 166-179 for an editorial loop.",
