  "motionAtlas.state-preserving-source-refresh.description":
    "A fresh source changes a record label while its stable identity, assigned worker and human status remain pinned. Unchanged records produce no write, and a missing source key is flagged without deleting the record.",
  "motionAtlas.state-preserving-source-refresh.distinction":
    "Unlike field-conflict-choice, no human chooses a winner between competing fields. The update mask structurally excludes human state, and a missing source does not mean deleting a person or closing a case.",
