  "motionAtlas.state-preserving-source-refresh.notFor.4":
    "All existing records begin with missing-from-source=false in this bounded example. Thus every source-absent record is newly flagged; repeated-refresh and reappearance cases require separate inputs and are not implied.",
  "motionAtlas.state-preserving-source-refresh.notFor.5":
    "Supplied prose is preserved. Fictional framing, source completeness and agreement between labels and structured state are author responsibilities. Runtime validation enforces structural bounds and exact cross-field rules.",
