  "motionAtlas.utterance-to-model-draft.creativeDirection":
    "Frames 0-11 reveal a short sentence on a 960x600 canvas. Frames 12-48 underline the supplied entity and relation tokens while all connector words remain in place. Frames 49-105 lift duplicate phrase slips from those exact spans into two entity sockets and one relationship hinge; an optional attribute slip docks to its declared entity. Frames 106-135 place the supplied review note and, only for accept, a human acceptance marker. Frames 136-167 hold the unchanged source sentence beside the complete proposed model. Fade to the common opaque palette ground at frames 168-179. All React/SVG motion is deterministic at 30fps and no language-model request is executed.",
  "motionAtlas.utterance-to-model-draft.default.copy.accepted":
    "Owner accepted the draft",
  "motionAtlas.utterance-to-model-draft.default.copy.attribute": "Attribute",
