  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.creativeDirection":
    "Over six seconds, reveal the two groups on opposite sides of a schematic local setting, each holding their own invitation. Each group actively marks its invitation accepted; only after both marks appear do the groups begin walking toward the chosen meeting place. They arrive, turn toward each other, and make the configured greeting gesture without merging their silhouettes. Hold the gathering and the two accepted invitations, then fade with the standard opaque envelope.",
