    "Proposed meeting",
  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.default.meetingLabel":
    "Example community meeting place",
  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.default.scenarioCaption":
    "Fictional reunion. Schematic setting.",
  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.description":
    "Two fictional family groups independently accept an arranged meeting and travel toward a shared meeting place. The scene centers their decisions and reunion rather than surveillance or automatic identity matching.",
  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.distinction":
    "Two independent acts of agreement precede self-directed physical movement and a human greeting. Unlike source-merge, the people remain individuals; unlike schema-mapping, there is no inferred identity match.",
  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.domains.0":
    "Human connection and movement",
  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.goodFor.0":
    "Illustrate an agreed reunion in a fictional displacement story",
  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.goodFor.1":
    "Explain why both parties participate in arranging a meeting",
  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.goodFor.2":
    "Show restored contact without implying automated identification",
  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.intent":
    "Show a reunion as a mutually chosen meeting between people, not a system matching records.",
  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.motionBeats.0":
    "Groups independently mark their invitations accepted in sequence.",
  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.motionBeats.1":
    "Only after both acceptances, each distinct person walks toward the meeting.",
  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.motionBeats.2":
    "Turn toward one another and perform the configured greeting.",
  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.motionBeats.3":
    "Hold every separate silhouette and both accepted invitations.",
  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.motionBeats.4":
    "Return to the opaque ground through the shared envelope.",
  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.name": "Meet by mutual agreement",
  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.notFor.0":
    "This portrays an already arranged fictional meeting, not tracing operations, identity verification, legal reunification, or safeguarding assessment.",
  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.notFor.1":
    "Group membership and silhouette counts come only from the supplied arrays and are illustrative, not statistics about displaced families.",
  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.notFor.2":
    "The setting has no geographic scale, real addresses, border crossings, or recommendations for travel.",
  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.notFor.3":
    "No photographs, biometric matching, distress imagery, or real personal data are used.",
  "motionAtlas.voluntary-family-reunion.prompt":
    "Meet by mutual agreement. Show a reunion as a mutually chosen meeting between people, not a system matching records.",
