  "motionAtlas.bounded-location-displacement.creativeDirection": [
    "React/SVG 960x600, shared palette, deterministic 180 frames at 30fps. Frames 0-12 reveal a local analysis inset with all supplied source locations and a completely empty display-copy map. Frames 13-70 compute each authored offset inside the local inset and show its distance against the bound. Frames 71-139 emit only the displaced coordinates onto the display-copy map, labeling every point approximate. Never place a source coordinate on the display map, even transiently. Hold all displaced points and separated local inset at 140-165, then fade both to the same opaque ground at 166-179.",
  ],
