  "motionAtlas.cache-reuse.creativeDirection": [
    "Reveal a requester, a small empty cache shelf, and a distant origin after frame 12. During 24..68, a key token probes the empty shelf, continues along the longer origin route, and returns carrying the supplied result. During 68..92, an identical result impression settles on the shelf while the requester receives its response. During 102..138, the same key token returns, matches the visible shelf key, and receives the stored result along the short local route without activating the origin. Hold both the keyed cache entry and returned response through 168, then exit. The second lookup visibly uses what the first lookup stored.",
  ],
