  "motionAtlas.effective-permission-grants.creativeDirection": [
    "960x600 React/SVG, shared palette, deterministic 180 frames at 30fps. Frames 0-12 reveal the scene. Frames 13-52 place each candidate on the none/view/edit/admin ladder. Frames 53-100 close gates for disabled conditions and for the app default when restriction applies. Frames 101-139 raise a result marker to the maximum eligible rank or leave it at none, then compare that marker visibly against a separate required-role notch to resolve allowed or denied. Hold the resolved meaning during frames 140-165. Frames 166-179 return to the same opaque ground for a six-second loop; reset is editorial.",
  ],
