    "960x600 React/SVG, shared palette, frame-driven 180 frames at 30fps. Frames 0-12 reveal the scene. Frames 13-50 reveal three compact tables with subscription connectors. Frames 51-90 place one category filter into its source socket. Frames 91-139 mask only nonmatching records in subscribed views, recompute their sums and retain all records in the unsubscribed view. Hold the resolved relationship at frames 140-165, then fade to the same opaque ground at 166-179. Reset is editorial.",
