  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.creativeDirection": [
    "Over six seconds, contributors tip small stacks of individually marked demo-credit tokens into a transparent shared tray. Earmarked tokens retain their destination ribbon; flexible tokens retain a distinct flexible marker. A community coordinator slides the configured tokens into labeled funding-request envelopes, preserving donor marks and respecting every earmark, while any unallocated tokens stay in the tray. Set each funded envelope upright with contributor marks visible above its edge, and hold the allocation totals alongside the remaining pool without transforming money into goods before the shared opaque exit fade. No token changes value, duplicates, or loses attribution.",
  ],
