  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.description": [
    "Contributor-marked demo credits gather in a transparent shared tray before being allocated to named funding requests. Earmarked credits keep their destination restriction, flexible credits can support different requests, and every unit remains attributable.",
  ],
  "motionAtlas.pooled-donor-allocation.distinction": [
    "Unlike source-merge, pooling is followed by a constrained physical allocation into separate funding requests, and contributor identity survives the entire sequence. The hero action is sorting and retaining attributed, restricted units, not convergence toward one destination or a fundraising counter.",
  ],
