  "motionAtlas.support-request-response.creativeDirection": [
    "Frames 12..42 show the requester with one unfinished work object and a short help request. Frames 43..88 let the colleague turn toward the requester, pause to acknowledge them and display the supplied response. Frames 89..130 bring a second chair to the same worktable only for joins. For later or declines, the colleague remains at their position and the task stays visibly open. Frames 131..167 hold the requester, unchanged work object and explicit response. Do not replace the request with a completed or emotionally resolved state. Use deterministic frame-driven React/SVG at 960x600, 180 frames and 30 fps, with the shared palette. Reveal during frames 0..11 and fade to the common opaque ground during frames 168..179.",
  ],
